      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales process was great, came and quoted within a week. Maybe a little bit pushy, but when I was unsure of something they supplied the information, and they went above and beyond to share their knowledge.  Also, when I was unhappy with a particular aspect, they fixed it immediately, no argument.Solahart had contractors install the system. They came weeks ahead of schedule when there was an unexpected sunny day. They were awesome, polite, respectful, efficient, even tidied up after themselves.Customer service was good except the communication between all parties could have been better.When I pushed to have them come out to turn the system on and set up my app after my energy provider upgraded by smart meter (instead of following the instructions I received in an email), they complied the very same day of my request.I had my solar up and running within weeks of getting the ball rolling. Outstanding!",
